w19-workspace-grant
-------------------

This directory is a clean-room Python 3 standard-library method sketch. It is
original work for this repository and contains no third-party code.

Paper (method idea credited)
----------------------------
Hui Zhao (Heurion Research). "Aegis OS: A Transactional Multi-Tenant Operating
System Runtime for Eliminating Authorization Fatigue in Autonomous Coding
Agents". arXiv:2611.08516, v1 submitted 22 Oct 2026.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.08516
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Only the method idea is used here: moving the approval unit from each action
to a workspace grant issued before the actions. Short excerpts quoted in
paper_evidence.json are attributed to the paper or its upstream README; no
paper text is reproduced in the code, fixtures or tests, and no changes to
the paper are implied.

